OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry with variable cloud and clear
OL,7,Fspells. Areas of fog are likely to
OL,8,Fform under clear skies, with a touch
OL,9,Fof rural frost in places as well.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,12,Fplaces which may be slow to clear.
OL,13,FOtherwise dry with variable cloud and
OL,14,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,15,FFrost and fog possible again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
